Alt+Down = Move Line Down
Alt+Up = Move Line Up
Primary+, = Preferences…
Primary+1 = Scene Heading
Primary+2 = Action
Primary+3 = Character
Primary+4 = Parenthetical
Primary+5 = Dialogue
Primary+6 = Transition
Primary+7 = Centered
Primary+8 = Lyrics
Primary+Alt+J = Next Source Passage
Primary+Alt+N = New Empty
Primary+B = Bold
Primary+E = Export…
Primary+F = Find…
Primary+G = Find Next
Primary+H = Replace…
Primary+I = Italic
Primary+N = New
Primary+O = Open…
Primary+P = Print…
Primary+S = Save
Primary+Shift+. = Fold or Unfold Here
Primary+Shift+Alt+N = New Empty Window
Primary+Shift+B = Tag Selection…
Primary+Shift+D = Cards
Primary+Shift+F = Fullscreen
Primary+Shift+G = Find Previous
Primary+Shift+H = Changes
Primary+Shift+K = Notes
Primary+Shift+L = Scene or Section Color…
Primary+Shift+N = New Window
Primary+Shift+O = Outline
Primary+Shift+P = Preview PDF
Primary+Shift+S = Save As…
Primary+Shift+T = Title Page…
Primary+Shift+Z = Redo
Primary+U = Underline
